BeefTV changes
--------------

BeefTV adapts and extends the upstream workspace into a local single-user
desktop application, including the Wails desktop shell, local SQLite and asset
workspace isolation, the durable Pi-based local Agent runtime, expanded media,
provider, and protocol integrations, and ongoing canvas, timeline, and
workspace UI updates.

